5. It calls a contract of the attacker with its key
   refused by the protocol: AccessKeyReceiverMismatchActionError Access key receiver sirius-ali-market.testnet does not match transaction receiver sirius-ali-mallory.testnet

6. It pays the market with a deposit of its own (0.1 NEAR on `order`)
   refused by the protocol: AccessKeyDepositWithFunctionCallActionError Deposit is not allowed with function call

7. It calls another method of the market (close_agent_budget)
   refused by the protocol: AccessKeyMethodNameMismatchActionError Access key does not allow method close_agent_budget

8. The agent drafts a report with this run's evidence; its key cannot file it, a human signs it (as in scripts/report-demo.sh)
   draft: report on sirius-ali-market.testnet, bond 0.05 NEAR, to be signed by the human who funds this agent (its key can only call order_with_budget)

